{"api_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/iree-org/iree/issues/21544","collected_at":"2026-09-27T21:56:04.558697+00:00","comments":[{"author_association":"NONE","body":"Solved by re-compiling iree environment and used the outputs to compile the mlir file and execute the vmfb module.  ","created_at":"2025-09-29T10:11:10Z","html_url":"https://github.com/iree-org/iree/issues/21544#issuecomment-3346117428","id":3346117428,"issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/iree-org/iree/issues/21544","minimized":null,"node_id":"IC_kwDODGgK6M7HcbM0","performed_via_github_app":null,"pin":null,"reactions":{"+1":0,"-1":0,"confused":0,"eyes":0,"heart":0,"hooray":0,"laugh":0,"rocket":0,"total_count":0,"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/iree-org/iree/issues/comments/3346117428/reactions"},"updated_at":"2025-09-29T10:11:10Z","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/iree-org/iree/issues/comments/3346117428","user":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/82616434?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lsauerr/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lsauerr/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lsauerr/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lsauerr/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/lsauerr","id":82616434,"login":"lsauerr","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgyNjE2NDM0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lsauerr/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lsauerr/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lsauerr/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lsauerr/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lsauerr/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/lsauerr","user_view_type":"public"}}],"issue":{"active_lock_reason":null,"assignee":null,"assignees":[],"author_association":"NONE","body":"This behavior is observed when trying to deploy a module within an embedded system. The module has been compiled on a host environment (x86_64) and the embedded system runs on aarch64.\n\nIt does not throw an error itself, it just halts execution with this message. Full message is:\n\n```\n./iree-run-module --device=vulkan --module=../YOLONAS-ONNX_v2.vmfb --function=main_graph --input=1x3x640x640xf32\niree/runtime/src/iree/vm/context.c:227: INTERNAL; import function hal.command_buffer.execution_barrier signature mismatch between module and source hal; expected 0riii_v but got 0riiI_v; resolving module 'module' imports; creating VM context; creating run context\n```\n\nThis is a YOLO-NAS model which was initially exported to an ONNX format and hen imported from ONNX with IREE tooling. Steps:\n```\npython3 load_yolo.py # load yolo model and export as onnx \niree-import-onnx model.onnx model.onnx -o model.mlir\niree-compile model.mlir --iree-hal-target-backend=vulkan-spirv --output-format=vm-bytecode -o model.vmfb\n# On the embedded system:\n./iree-run-module --device=vulkan --module=model.vmfb --function=main_graph --input=1x3x640x640\n```\nThanks for the support.\n","closed_at":"2025-09-29T10:11:10Z","closed_by":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/82616434?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lsauerr/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lsauerr/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lsauerr/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lsauerr/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/lsauerr","id":82616434,"login":"lsauerr","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgyNjE2NDM0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lsauerr/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lsauerr/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lsauerr/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lsauerr/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lsauerr/subscriptions","type":